@url=http://localhost:3000

### Login para obtener token
# @name login
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "juan@gmail.com",
    "password": "Minuscula123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Obtener viajes
GET {{url}}/viajes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar por un viaje

GET {{url}}/viajes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar viajes por vehiculo
GET {{url}}/viajes/vehiculo/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar viajes por conductor
GET {{url}}/viajes/conductor/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear viaje

POST {{url}}/viajes
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "vehiculo_id": 4,
  "conductor_id": 1,
  "fecha_salida": "2026-11-06",
  "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-07",
  "origen": "La Rioja",
  "destino": "Cordoba",
  "kilometros": 430,
  "observaciones": "Carga general"
}

### Actualizar viaje

PUT {{url}}/viajes/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "vehiculo_id": 4,
  "conductor_id": 1,
  "fecha_salida": "2026-11-06",
  "fecha_llegada": "2026-11-07",
  "origen": "La Rioja",
  "destino": "Mendoza",
  "kilometros": 650,
  "observaciones": "Entrega urgente"
}

### Eliminar viaje
DELETE {{url}}/viajes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}